## What's happening?
The sending queue for exporter `{{exporter.name}}` averaged **{{value}}** of capacity for the full last 10 minutes, above the 80% threshold. This monitor covers every exporter on purpose: it is both a leading indicator of enqueue failures and the attribution tool, because whichever exporter's queue is growing is the one consuming Collector memory.
